{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115192","id":3192599948,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6-SzWM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115192","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115192.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115192.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115192","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115192/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115192/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115192/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2a9becc70df9d50a6618cac6f61668ea77bcf182","number":115192,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `has_script_method` to `Script` for scripting access","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This addresses a longstanding TODO around the use of `Script::has_method` versus `Object::has_method`.\r\n\r\nIn the `Script` class, the method `has_method` was introduced as a way to identify whether a specific script declares a specific method, since `get_script_method_list` returns all methods from the given script instance up through all its non-native ancestors' script classes. \r\n\r\nOn the Engine side, this reimplementation does not cause any issues; however, it presents an issue from GDExtension, as the call to `Script::has_method` delegates to the `Object::has_method` binding, and not the virtual redeclaration of the same method on `Script`.\r\n\r\nWith the closing of 4.6 and 4.7 around the corner, it made sense to go ahead and address this. This PR aligns both `has_method` and `has_static_method` methods on the `Script` class with the _script_ moniker prefix, aligning them with other methods like `has_script_signal`.\r\n\r\nWith this change, GDExtension code can now call `Script::has_script_method` on a GDScript instance, and it will invoke the `GScript::has_script_method` call rather than delegating to `Object` as it did previously.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https